# Canonical author identities for the Ragnar TTRPG Platform.
# Maps the many git identities used across the original repositories to one
# name + email per person, so `git shortlog -sne` and `git log` show a clean,
# accurate contributor list. Format:
#   Proper Name <proper@email> <commit@email>

